        "count": 1,
        "body": "This issue lists the items of `kernel-y` that no code outside tests names, and its exported items that no other crate names (#2891).\n\n`mise run report:dead-weight` writes the tables each night from the compiler's records of `ccccccccc`. It leaves out an item that a commit touched in the last 14 days, and each item in `.config/dead-weight/kept.txt`. A unit that deletes or narrows an item cites this issue. An item that a decision keeps goes into the kept list with its decision.\n\n## Exported with no use in another crate\n\nThe table gives each exported item that only its own crate names. The refactoring is `consolidate`: narrow the item's visibility.\n\n| Item | Visibility | Callers | Since |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [`gandr_kernel_y::Shape`](https://github.com/gandr-lang/gandr/blob/cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc/crates/kernel-y/src/lib.rs#L7) | `pub` | its crate only | 2026-09-01 |"
